<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-PAKISTAN V ZIMBABWE 1ST TEST DRAWN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN V ZIMBABWE 1ST TEST DRAWN.</headline>
<dateline>SHEIKHUPURA, Pakistan 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The first test between Pakistan and Zimbabwe ended in a draw on the fifth and final day on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: Zimbabwe 375 and 241-7, Pakistan 553.</p>
</text>
